{{- /* The ssh_config field of this Mac's vault's "dotfiles" note, pasted in as is, so the public repo
       never contains a host, address or user. To add or change a host, edit that field and run
       `chezmoi apply`. CI has no 1Password and gets only the agent block. */ -}}
